'' std/containers (RFC-0009): a generic Array filled, Sort'ed and passed to an FB.Array( of long ) parameter; Map, Set, the generic Contains and HashOf.
'' It is a facade -- exported macros over the header, found through -i as a user's toolchain
'' finds it in its inc/ -- and the program includes that header too, so the facade's names
'' and the header's FB names are shown to be one and the same.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/containers.bas -o tests/modules/stdcontainers.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdcontainers.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 2 3 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 7 true true -1
